{"unit_id":"keyiadiannao__dsh-delay-tools#card-zh","repo":"keyiadiannao/dsh-delay-tools","commit":"c058ba7738a3b3f8d3bbfad9e6d0626db9c626f7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-delay-tools 是面向 DSH 的工具插件，提供跨轮次提醒和定时等待。它在宿主端注册 schedule_reminder 与 wait：前者创建插件作用域计时器，到期后通过 agent.followup() 将消息送回同一会话；后者阻塞当前回合，并响应停止信号。可设置默认、最小和最大延时，提醒到期会返回触发时间与待处理数量。适合需要稍后提醒、暂停流程或测试等待期间消息排队的 DSH 用户。提醒保存在进程内存，重启主机后会丢失；不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:47-51","src/index.ts:98-107","src/index.ts:109-246"]}
{"unit_id":"keyiadiannao__dsh-delay-tools#card-en","repo":"keyiadiannao/dsh-delay-tools","commit":"c058ba7738a3b3f8d3bbfad9e6d0626db9c626f7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-delay-tools adds two DSH tools: schedule_reminder sends a delayed message to the same conversation; wait pauses the current turn until its timer ends or stop interrupts it. Delay limits are configurable. Use it for reminders and pauses. Reminders vanish on host restart; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:47-51","src/index.ts:98-107","src/index.ts:109-246"]}
